# Compiled command entry points built into the workspace bin folder
/bin/

# Stray binaries written to the project root by a bare `go build <package>`.
#
# Every pattern below is root-anchored with a leading slash on purpose. A bare
# pattern such as `topsailai` matches a directory of that name at any depth, so
# it would silently exclude the fixture source tree `tests/fixtures/topsailai/`
# and the command source trees under `src/main/`. Anchoring keeps the source
# directories tracked while still ignoring the executable that a bare build
# drops beside this file.
/agent-cluster-server
/agent-cluster-endpoint
/agent-cluster-cli
/provider
/topsailai
/topsailai_session_info

# Test binaries produced by `go test -c` and similar tooling.
*.test
